/// The bold header name for both VCS kinds: the branch/bookmark the working copy is on.
///
/// Routed through `AppStore.branchName(for:)` — the single accessor every branch-showing surface
/// uses — so this header, the status bar, the sidebar and the VCS toolbar cannot disagree about the
/// same workroom. `detached` is this header's own fallback: the other surfaces omit the segment
/// entirely when there's no name, but this one is a labelled capsule that needs something in it.
private func branchLabel(sid: SidebarID, status: WorkroomStatus) -> String {
  store.branchName(for: sid) ?? "detached"
}

